  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening &apos;Do No Harm&apos; and &apos;Survivors&apos; Centeredness&apos; Principles in Application Process for Yezidi Female Survivor&apos;s Law</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to strengthen the evidence-base regarding the criminal investigation requirement of the YSL through clearly understanding the implications of this requirement on &#x2018;do no harm&#x2019; and &#x2018;survivor centeredness&#x2019; principles, and on the ability of survivors to access reparations under the YSL framework exploring barriers to accessing the full range of justice measures to survivors in Iraq.</narrative>
  </description>
